+    ///
+    /// - Important
+    /// Unlike ``removeAllInteractions(thread:deleteForMeSyncMessagePolicy:tx:)``,
+    /// this always sends a `DeleteForMe` sync message so the local user's
+    /// other devices reflect the same, per-message-addressed deletion.
+    func removeAllInteractionsSentByLocalUser(
